  "definition": "VPC = (1 - \\frac{\\text{brake pad wear percent} + \\text{track wear percent}}{200}) \\times \\frac{\\text{vehicle speed (km/h)}}{50} \\times \\frac{\\text{engine load percent}}{100}, \\text{ where lower wear percentages and optimal engine load contribute to better performance.}"
}

